{"3764710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Aetheria", "steam_appid": 3764710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build up from nothing, stranded on the coast of an island, by yourself or with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764710/extras/f227bf1f07f666ca05f4cd46994cd29b.avif?t=1777415661\" width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build with an expanding selection of floors, furnitures, lighting and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764710/extras/59f231f035751670307c6ade6a6f422d.avif?t=1777415661\" width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the local wildlife, some of them friendly, some of them hungry!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764710/extras/68639ffee3821da8918edae74f5da58b.avif?t=1777415661\" width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764710/extras/d026d21f0bcf7baa269c4718510dbe0c.avif?t=1777415661\" width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and captain your vessel, careful not to make it too heavy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764710/extras/9cfdcb821e9e602e366fd1f3ed4eb8dc.avif?t=1777415661\" width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish up some dinner, or maybe some ol