d1f3ed4eb8dc.avif?t=1777415661\" width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish up some dinner, or maybe some old treasure left behind by a lost civilization!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764710/extras/c85d066c5e4f533b9b3a55f7415383f0.avif?t=1777415661\" width=1560 height=877 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Aetheria is a survival crafting game where you explore islands in a vast ocean, gather resources, build bases and physics-driven vehicles, catch fish, slay monsters and unlock recipes in a procedurally generated voxel world.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764710/720b58fea7785a80647cc64a4f979c7e909a89cf/header.jpg?t=1777415661", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764710/4ee8e9ae3eb07cb40c312b4a3aa32b9f9167f27b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777415661", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764710/4ee8e9ae3eb07cb40c312b4a3aa32b9f9167f27b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777415661", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-7400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 960<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Onboard audio<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Specifications may change during Early Access</li></